#  Tokiwa Software GmbH, Germany
#
#  Source code of Fuzion test reg_issue8084
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------

# This test resulted in an IndexOutOfBoundsException since an actual argument
# for the call to `x` was set after it was detected and reported that type
# inference failed and the call was marked as `defunct()`
#
reg_issue8084 =>

  # original example from the issue:

  x(V type, v T) =>
  y => x y.0

  # some more variants:
  y1 => x (y1,unit)
  y2 => x y2.as_string
  y3 => x (option y3)
  y4 => x (if true then panic "***" else y4)
  y5 => x <| y5
